# My John Workflow

After completing these tasks, the overall workflow became:

```text
1. Identify what I am cracking
             ↓
2. If necessary, convert it
             ↓
3. Identify the hash format
             ↓
4. Choose John's format
             ↓
5. Choose wordlist / single mode / custom rule
             ↓
6. Run John
             ↓
7. Use --show to display recovered password
             ↓
8. If it is an archive/key, use the password on it
```

## Conversion tools I learned

```text
/etc/shadow → unshadow
ZIP         → zip2john
RAR         → rar2john
SSH key     → ssh2john
```

